. * Wald tests with Stata's own commands
. test egox_alcohol1 = altx_alcohol1

 ( 1)  - altx_alcohol1 + egox_alcohol1 = 0

           chi2(  1) =    0.98
         Prob > chi2 =    0.3234

. lincom egox_alcohol1 - altx_alcohol1

 ( 1)  - altx_alcohol1 + egox_alcohol1 = 0

